1. **PHC Portal Modal Layout**: Fixed vertical modal overflow in [Programs.js](file:///c:/Users/ELCOT/Desktop/Lifeline360/Lifeline360/frontend/src/pages/phc/components/Programs.js) when attaching multiple evidence files.
