## Key Technical Changes

### 1. PHC Component: Report Completion Modal Layout
- **Target File**: [frontend/src/pages/phc/components/Programs.js](file:///c:/Users/ELCOT/Desktop/Lifeline360/Lifeline360/frontend/src/pages/phc/components/Programs.js)
- **Key Enhancements**:
  - Constrained modal container to `maxHeight: '88vh'` with `display: flex` and `flexDirection: column`.
  - Created a fixed top header containing the modal title, subtext, and close (`✕`) button.
  - Placed notes and upload dropzone inside a scrollable middle body (`flex: 1`, `overflowY: 'auto'`).
  - Added a `maxHeight: '180px'` scrollable container for selected evidence files (`Screenshot (1).png` ... `Screenshot (12).png`).
  - Anchored action buttons (**Cancel** & **Submit Report**) to a sticky bottom footer.

### 2. DDHS Component: Task Completion Report & In-App Evidence Viewer
- **Target File**: [frontend/src/pages/ddhs/WorkAssignments.js](file:///c:/Users/ELCOT/Desktop/Lifeline360/Lifeline360/frontend/src/pages/ddhs/WorkAssignments.js)
- **Key Enhancements**:
  - **In-App Lightbox Modal**: Created a full-featured preview modal for images and PDF documents directly on screen.
  - **Blob URL Opener (`openInNewTab`)**: Converts base64 `data:` URIs into binary `Blob` objects (`URL.createObjectURL(blob)`) so files open directly in browser tabs without initiating hard drive downloads.
  - **Bounded Report View Modal**: Added `maxHeight: '88vh'` with a `200px` scrollable attached evidence list and fixed sticky bottom action buttons (**Request Changes** & **Approve & Complete**).

### 3. Backend: Email Mapping & Overdue Scheduler
